  "operations": [
    "Matte each pack with build_collection_set.matte (traced edges; geometry mirrored about the cap axis; no pixel mirrored)",
    "Normalise RGB by the measured backdrop colour; keep source pixels inside the matte only; discard the original studio cast shadow",
    "Downscale only (asserted scale <= 1 for every pack in every master), bicubic with area pre-reduction, no sharpening",
    "Compose a grouped still life: serum and cleanser behind (0.92 depth scale), eye cream front-left, jar front-right and lowest; real relative sizes; overlaps only on plain body edges / the serum chrome collar, never on a name or wordmark",
    "Add the Collection synthetic contact shadow (same pools, tint, upper-right key) per pack, on the ground only (every pack is composited over the shadow layer)",
    "Encode transparent AVIF/WebP; JPEG fallback flattened on RGB 251,250,247"
  ],
